"享受轻抚" = "Enjoying gentle petting";
"伸个懒腰，今天也是好天气。" = "A long stretch for another lovely day.";
"伸懒腰" = "Stretching";
"你又来了，门前的位置还留着。" = "You are back. Your spot by the door is still here.";
"你可以靠近一点，也可以一起晒太阳。" = "Come a little closer, or share a patch of sunshine.";
"再见之前，留一盏小灯。" = "A little light, until we meet again.";
"出门" = "Coming outside";
"去那边坐坐，好吗？" = "Shall we sit over there?";
"可以不说话，一起晒会儿太阳。" = "No need for words. Just share the sunshine.";
"喵。它还记得你轻轻靠近的样子。" = "Meow. It remembers your gentle company.";
"喵。很高兴你来了。" = "Meow. So glad you came.";
"嗯，这样轻轻的，刚刚好。" = "Mmm. That gentle touch is just right.";
"嘘，窗边的小猫还在做梦。" = "Shh. The little cat by the window is still dreaming.";
"回屋" = "Going home";
"好奇地看看" = "Looking around";
"它在你身旁，安静坐着。" = "It sits quietly beside you.";
"它已经看到你啦，轻轻等一会儿。" = "It has noticed you. Give it a moment.";
"它想自己整理一会儿，也愿意看看你。" = "It needs a little time to itself, but is happy to see you.";
"它抬起爪子，想请你靠近一点。" = "A little raised paw invites you closer.";
"它看了看树叶，又悄悄看看你。" = "It watches the leaves, then steals a glance at you.";
"它看到邀请了，想先歇一小会儿。" = "It saw your invitation, but needs a short rest.";
"它靠着你的手，慢慢放松下来。" = "It leans into your hand and slowly relaxes.";
"就在你身边啦。" = "Right here beside you.";
"打招呼" = "Saying hello";
"换个地方坐坐" = "Moving to another spot";
"换个姿势，继续陪你。" = "A comfier pose, still here with you.";
"换个舒服的姿势" = "Getting comfortable";
"整理毛发" = "Grooming";
"晒太阳" = "Resting in the sun";
"来啦，往你这边走。" = "Coming over to you.";
"来啦，正在往你这边走。" = "Coming! It is walking over to you.";
"睡觉" = "Sleeping";
"稍等一下，它想把毛毛理顺。" = "Just a moment. A little grooming first.";
"等它站稳，再和它打招呼。" = "Let it settle, then say hello.";
"等它走到门前，再轻轻靠近。" = "Let it reach the doorstep, then gently come closer.";
"轻轻的，它已经感觉到了。" = "Gently does it. It can feel your touch.";
"邀请你靠近" = "Inviting you closer";
"醒来" = "Waking up";
"门开了。有个小家伙想见你。" = "The door opens. Someone little wants to meet you.";
